# Store text with LF line endings, whatever the platform that commits it.
# Cygnus, the Windows desktop, writes CRLF from PowerShell and .NET tools.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The game's evidence index gains one entry per bead, at its end, so parallel beads collided there
# on nearly every rebase in M2 (ps-msz.4.2). Union keeps both sides' entries instead.
game/evidence/README.md merge=union
